From: GitHub Copilot <copilot@github.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Nov 2025 16:16:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Optimize backend and frontend performance

- Fix RabbitMQ: Reuse global connection in ModeratorWorker
- Optimize HTTP: Reuse HTTP client for OpenAI API calls
- Fix memory leak: Remove duplicate event listeners in Map.tsx
- Extract components: Move StarIcons to separate file
- Optimize DB queries: Fix count query to use same filters
